<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A2.SS6" title="In Appendix B Experimental Details and More Results ‣ Can Language Models Compose Skills In-Context?" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">B.6 </span>Detailed results about CoT</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A2.SS7" title="In Appendix B Experimental Details and More Results ‣ Can Language Models Compose Skills In-Context?" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">B.7 </span>The experiment before ExpCoT: adding tags to samples</span></a>
<ol class="ltx_toclist ltx_toclist_subsection">
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#A2.SS7.SSS0.Px1" title="In B.7 The experiment before ExpCoT: adding tags to samples ‣ Appendix B Experimental Details and More Results ‣ Can Language Models Compose Skills In-Context?" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Result.</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A2.SS8" title="In Appendix B Experimental Details and More Results ‣ Can Language Models Compose Skills In-Context?" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">B.8 </span>Detailed results about ExpCoT</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_appendix"><a href="#A3" title="In Can Language Models Compose Skills In-Context?" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">C </span>Details of Theoretical Analysis</span></a></li>
</ol></nav>
