on/x-tex">\displaystyle=\mathbb{E}_{\{\mathcal{S}_{t}\}}\mathcal{L}(\mathcal{M};\mathcal{S}_{0},\mathcal{S}_{\sigma(1)},\ldots,\mathcal{S}_{\sigma(T)};\mathcal{D}_{\sigma(\sigma^{-1}(0))},f_{\sigma(\sigma^{-1}(0))})</annotation></semantics></math></td>
